@baseUrl = http://47.97.46.242/api/v1
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@categoryId = replace-with-category-uuid

### Public: science categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?scope=SCIENCE

### Public: course categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?scope=COURSE

### Public: product categories (default when scope is omitted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?scope=PRODUCT

### Admin: all scopes, including disabled categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: create science category
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"健康科普","scope":"SCIENCE","sortOrder":0,"enabled":true}

### Admin: create course category
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"健康课程","scope":"COURSE","sortOrder":0,"enabled":true}

### Admin: update category with latest version (scope is immutable)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"name":"基础课程","sortOrder":10,"enabled":true}

### Admin: delete only an unreferenced category, using its latest version
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/{{categoryId}}?version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
